# Raw and processed market data are NOT committed: several sources are
# licensed (MSCI, Ibbotson/Morningstar, S&P, Nasdaq). They are re-downloaded
# and checksum-verified by `python -m gem.research`. Manifests ARE committed.
research/data/raw/**
!research/data/raw/.gitkeep
research/data/processed/**
!research/data/processed/.gitkeep
# Per-run monthly series of benchmark runs are effectively redistributed index
# returns (MSCI/S&P/Bloomberg) -> not committed. Summary metrics, annual returns,
# signal histories and regime changes of strategy runs ARE committed.
# (open-source runs - FRED, Riksbank, Ken French - ARE committed incl. monthly.csv)
research/reports/generated/runs/*3P*/monthly.csv
research/reports/generated/runs/DIAG_*/monthly.csv
research/reports/generated/runs/BUY_HOLD_US_*3P*/**
research/reports/generated/runs/BUY_HOLD_EXUS_*3P*/**
research/reports/generated/runs/BUY_HOLD_US_AGG_*3P*/**
research/reports/generated/runs/STATIC_70_30_US_*3P*/**
research/.venv/
research/data/manual/**
# Local secrets and local databases (never committed)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
.DS_Store
.ipynb_checkpoints/
